# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values appropriate for your environment.
**Never commit `.env` to source control.**

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

---

## Azure OpenAI (required)

> Authentication uses `DefaultAzureCredential` — no API key is needed or accepted.
> Ensure the running identity has the **Cognitive Services OpenAI User** role on the resource.

```env
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://<your-resource-name>.openai.azure.com/
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-4o
AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-02-01
```

---

## Retry Configuration

```env
RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS=3
RETRY_BASE_DELAY=1.0
```

---

## Logging

```env
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json
```
